  "foaf:name": "Protecting Our Oceans, Protecting Our Health: Reducing Plastic Pollution",
  "sdo:name": "Protecting Our Oceans, Protecting Our Health: Reducing Plastic Pollution",
  "sdo:description": "Minderoo is committed to reducing the harmful impacts of plastics through generating evidence that establishes the causal link between plastics and human health; and supporting innovative pathways to safe and sustainable alternatives. Alongside this, we are advocating for a global plastics treaty framework.",
